---
import { ArrowUpRight01Icon, Layers01Icon, WorkflowSquare01Icon } from "@hugeicons/core-free-icons";
import Frame from "../components/Frame.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const heading = "mb-3.5 text-[0.78rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] text-primary";
const title = "flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[1.05rem] font-semibold leading-snug";
---

<Layout
	description="临界有光，边界可通。做极简、可靠的产品，持续探索技术前沿。"
>
	<Frame>
		<section class="mt-15 max-sm:mt-12">
			<h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(2.6rem,7vw,3.5rem)] leading-[1.15] font-medium tracking-tight">
				<span class="max-[480px]:block">临界有光，</span><span class="max-[480px]:block">边界可通</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-1.5 font-serif text-[1.02rem] text-faint italic">Where edges meet, glimmers emerge.</p>
			<p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-muted-foreground">做极简、可靠的产品，持续探索技术前沿。</p>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-15 max-sm:mt-12">
			<h2 class={heading}>关于</h2>
			<p class="max-w-xl">
				名字由 Glimmer 与 Verge 拼合而来。Verge
				指临界，站在突破的边缘；Glimmer
				是微光，寻求突破的那一缕契机。工作站在突破的边缘上，以探索未知、寻求契机为主。AI
				与全栈是手段。
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-15 max-sm:mt-12">
			<h2 class={heading}>方向</h2>
			<ul class="grid list-none gap-[1.15rem] p-0">
				<li class="grid grid-cols-1 items-baseline gap-0.5 sm:grid-cols-[10.5rem_1fr] sm:gap-5">
					<h3 class={title}>
						<Icon icon={WorkflowSquare01Icon} />
						AI 与工作流
					</h3>
					<p class="text-muted-foreground">
						<span class="max-sm:block">将新能力纳入真实工作流，</span><span class="max-sm:block"
							>试出可促成突破的路径。</span
						>
					</p>
				</li>
				<li class="grid grid-cols-1 items-baseline gap-0.5 sm:grid-cols-[10.5rem_1fr] sm:gap-5">
					<h3 class={title}>
						<Icon icon={Layers01Icon} />
						全栈工程
					</h3>
					<p class="text-muted-foreground">从前端到后端贯通实现，让试探能够持续落地。</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-15 max-sm:mt-12">
			<h2 class={heading}>项目</h2>
			<a class="group grid gap-1 text-inherit no-underline" href="/projects/moomem">
				<h3 class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[1.35rem] font-semibold tracking-tight group-hover:text-primary">
					moomem
					<Icon icon={ArrowUpRight01Icon} />
				</h3>
				<p class="text-muted-foreground">MoonBit 嵌入式 Agent 记忆层。零部署、崩溃可恢复、按用户隔离。</p>
			</a>
		</section>
	</Frame>
</Layout>
